--- PART 2: MODEL M1 -- the n-free family, pooled fit (n, a0 free) ---
  fit: n* = 3.1610 +- (cluster-boot, below), a0* = 3.0842e-11, pooled rms = 0.1981 dex (N = 747)
  cluster bootstrap (galaxy groups, 400 draws): n* = 3.161 +- 0.347, a0* = 3.084e-11 +- 4.45e-12
